    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "For the buyer, the first step is to visit the Amazon.com Marketplace."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "Once there, they should search for a book."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "After finding the desired book,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "they can add a used copy to their cart."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "Once the used copy is added, they can proceed to complete the purchase."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "Finally, the process ends."
    }
